#: ../../library/gzip.rst:2
msgid ":mod:`gzip` --- gzip compression & decompression"
msgstr ":mod:`gzip` --- kompresi & dekompresi gzip"

#: ../../library/gzip.rst:7
msgid ""
"This module allows compression and decompression of binary data with the "
"`DEFLATE algorithm <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/DEFLATE>`_ used by the "
"gzip file format.  It provides one-shot :func:`compress`/:func:`decompress` "
"helpers and a streaming :class:`GzipFile` wrapper around an underlying file "
"or stream object."
msgstr ""
"Modul ini memungkinkan kompresi dan dekompresi data biner dengan `algoritma "
"DEFLATE <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/DEFLATE>`_ yang digunakan oleh format"
" berkas gzip. Modul ini menyediakan pembantu sekali-jalan :func:`compress`\\"
" /\\ :func:`decompress` dan pembungkus streaming :class:`GzipFile` di "
"sekitar objek berkas atau stream yang mendasarinya."

#: ../../library/gzip.rst:13
msgid ""
"Prefer to use :class:`deflate.DeflateIO` instead of the functions in this "
"module as it provides a streaming interface to compression and decompression"
" which is convenient and more memory efficient when working with reading or "
"writing compressed data to a file, socket, or stream."
msgstr ""
"Lebih baik gunakan :class:`deflate.DeflateIO` alih-alih fungsi dalam modul "
"ini karena menyediakan antarmuka streaming ke kompresi dan dekompresi yang "
"nyaman dan lebih efisien memori saat bekerja dengan membaca atau menulis "
"data terkompresi ke berkas, soket, atau stream."

#: ../../library/gzip.rst:18
msgid "**Availability:**"
msgstr "**Ketersediaan:**"

#: ../../library/gzip.rst:20
msgid ""
"This module is **not included on the OpenMV Cam** by default, as it "
"duplicates functionality already provided by the :mod:`deflate <deflate>` "
"module."
msgstr ""
"Modul ini **tidak disertakan pada OpenMV Cam** secara default, karena "
"menduplikasi fungsionalitas yang sudah disediakan oleh modul :mod:`deflate "
"<deflate>`\\ ."

#: ../../library/gzip.rst:24
msgid ""
"A copy can be installed (or frozen into custom firmware) from "
":term:`micropython-lib` (`source "
"<https://github.com/micropython/micropython-lib/blob/master/python-"
"stdlib/gzip/gzip.py>`_). See :ref:`packages` for more information. This "
"documentation describes that module."
msgstr ""
"Salinannya dapat diinstal (atau dibekukan ke dalam firmware kustom) dari "
":term:`micropython-lib` (\\ `sumber "
"<https://github.com/micropython/micropython-lib/blob/master/python-"
"stdlib/gzip/gzip.py>`_\\ ). Lihat :ref:`packages` untuk informasi lebih "
"lanjut. Dokumentasi ini mendeskripsikan modul tersebut."

#: ../../library/gzip.rst:28
msgid ""
"Compression is only available if compression is available in the built-in "
":mod:`deflate <deflate>` module -- that is, not on the STM32-based OpenMV "
"Cams (see its availability note above)."
msgstr ""
"Kompresi hanya tersedia jika kompresi tersedia dalam modul bawaan "
":mod:`deflate <deflate>` -- yaitu, tidak pada OpenMV Cam berbasis STM32 "
"(lihat catatan ketersediaannya di atas)."

#: ../../library/gzip.rst:33
msgid "Functions"
msgstr "Fungsi"

#: ../../library/gzip.rst:37
msgid "Wrapper around built-in :func:`open` returning a GzipFile instance."
msgstr ""
"Pembungkus di sekitar :func:`open` bawaan yang mengembalikan instans "
"GzipFile."

#: ../../library/gzip.rst:41
msgid "Decompresses *data* into a bytes object."
msgstr "Mendekompresi *data* menjadi objek bytes."

#: ../../library/gzip.rst:45
msgid "Compresses *data* into a bytes object."
msgstr "Mengompresi *data* menjadi objek bytes."

#: ../../library/gzip.rst:48
msgid "Classes"
msgstr "Kelas"

#: ../../library/gzip.rst:52
msgid ""
"This class can be used to wrap a *fileobj* which is any :term:`stream-like "
"<stream>` object such as a file, socket, or stream (including "
":class:`io.BytesIO`). It is itself a stream and implements the standard "
"read/readinto/write/close methods."
msgstr ""
"Kelas ini dapat digunakan untuk membungkus *fileobj* yang merupakan objek "
":term:`seperti stream <stream>` apa pun seperti berkas, soket, atau stream "
"(termasuk :class:`io.BytesIO`\\ ). Kelas ini sendiri merupakan stream dan "
"mengimplementasikan metode read/readinto/write/close standar."

#: ../../library/gzip.rst:57
msgid ""
"When the *mode* argument is ``\"rb\"``, reads from the GzipFile instance "
"will decompress the data in the underlying stream and return decompressed "
"data."
msgstr ""
"Ketika argumen *mode* adalah ``\"rb\"``\\ , pembacaan dari instans GzipFile "
"akan mendekompresi data dalam stream yang mendasarinya dan mengembalikan "
"data yang telah didekompresi."

#: ../../library/gzip.rst:60
msgid ""
"If compression support is enabled then the *mode* argument can be set to "
"``\"wb\"``, and writes to the GzipFile instance will be compressed and "
"written to the underlying stream."
msgstr ""
"Jika dukungan kompresi diaktifkan maka argumen *mode* dapat disetel ke "
"``\"wb\"``\\ , dan penulisan ke instans GzipFile akan dikompres dan ditulis "
"ke stream yang mendasarinya."

#: ../../library/gzip.rst:64
msgid ""
"By default the GzipFile class will read and write data using the gzip file "
"format, including a header and footer with checksum and a window size of 512"
" bytes."
msgstr ""
"Secara default kelas GzipFile akan membaca dan menulis data menggunakan "
"format berkas gzip, termasuk header dan footer dengan checksum dan ukuran "
"jendela 512 byte."

#: ../../library/gzip.rst:68
msgid ""
"The **file**, **compresslevel**, and **mtime** arguments are not supported. "
"**fileobj** and **mode** must always be specified as keyword arguments."
msgstr ""
"Argumen **file**\\ , **compresslevel**\\ , dan **mtime** tidak didukung. "
"**fileobj** dan **mode** harus selalu ditentukan sebagai argumen kata kunci."

